From c5e8d80fbb5acc4544158877217808302eb354f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diva Patches <patches@diva.local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 04:34:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(pos): share an invoice from the invoice detail (E-18)

Show Download PDF and Open in WhatsApp next to Print in the invoice detail
dialog. Download PDF opens the Diva A4 print preview with trigger_print;
Open in WhatsApp calls diva_guard.share.invoice_share (normalized Egyptian
number, ready Arabic or English message) and opens the wa.me link. Local-only
(offline) invoices and drafts hide the share actions.
---
 .../invoices/InvoiceDetailDialog.vue          | 128 ++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 114 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

